        "基础使用": {
            "en-us": "Basic usage"
        },
        "基础的无边框、无边框描述列表。": {
            "en-us": "Basic description lists."
        },
        "使用items定义子项": {
            "en-us": "Define items with items"
        },
        "推荐使用参数`items`代替`children`进行子项的定义。": {
            "en-us": "Use `items` instead of `children` to define items."
        },
        "垂直布局模式": {
            "en-us": "Vertical layout"
        },
        "设置参数`layout='vertical'`开启垂直布局模式。": {
            "en-us": "Set `layout='vertical'` for a vertical layout."
        },
        "控制每行宽度份数": {
            "en-us": "Width units per row"
        },
        "通过参数`column`控制每行宽度份数。": {
            "en-us": "Use `column` to set the width units per row."
        },
        "控制子项所占单位宽度": {
            "en-us": "Item width units"
        },
        "通过参数`span`控制子项所占单位宽度。": {
            "en-us": "Use `span` to set an item's width units."
        },
        "子项自动填充剩余宽度": {
            "en-us": "Fill the remaining row width"
        },
